"gloss":"well-fitted lid"},{"surface":"செப்பில்","parts":[{"text":"செப்பு","lemma":"ceppu","gloss":"casket"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"in (locative)"}],"gloss":"in the casket"},{"surface":"தமிய","parts":[{"text":"தமிய","lemma":"tamiya","gloss":"solitary"}],"gloss":"solitary"},{"surface":"வைகிய","parts":[{"text":"வைகிய","lemma":"vaikiya","gloss":"having stayed"}],"gloss":"having stayed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெய்யா","parts":[{"text":"பெய்யா","lemma":"peyyā","gloss":"unworn"}],"gloss":"unworn"},{"surface":"பூவின்","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"pū","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"in","gloss":"like (comparative)"}],"gloss":"like a flower"},{"surface":"மெய்","parts":[{"text":"மெய்","lemma":"mey","gloss":"body"}],"gloss":"body"},{"surface":"சாயினளே","parts":[{"text":"சாயினள்","lemma":"cāyiṉaḷ","gloss":"she who wasted away"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she has wasted away"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாசடை","parts":[{"text":"பாசு","lemma":"pācu","gloss":"green"},{"text":"அடை","lemma":"aṭai","gloss":"leaf"}],"gloss":"green leaf"},{"surface":"நிவந்த","parts":[{"text":"நிவந்த","lemma":"nivanta","gloss":"grown tall"}],"gloss":"grown tall"},{"surface":"கணைக்கால்","parts":[{"text":"கணை","lemma":"kaṇai","gloss":"round/thick"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"kāl","gloss":"stem"}],"gloss":"thick-stemmed"},{"surface":"நெய்தல்","parts":[{"text":"நெய்தல்","lemma":"neytal","gloss":"water lily"}],"gloss":"water lily"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இனமீன்","parts":[{"text":"இனமீன்","lemma":"iṉamīṉ","gloss":"shoal of fish"}],"gloss":"shoal of fish"},{"surface":"இருங்கழி","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"irum","gloss":"dark/large"},{"text":"கழி","lemma":"kaḻi","gloss":"backwater"}],"gloss":"dark backwater"},{"surface":"ஓதம்","parts":[{"text":"ஓதம்","lemma":"ōtam","gloss":"tide/flood"}],"gloss":"tide"},{"surface":"மல்குதொறும்","parts":[{"text":"மல்கு","lemma":"malku","gloss":"overflow"},{"text":"தொறும்","lemma":"toṟum","gloss":"every time"}],"gloss":"whenever it overflows"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கயம்","parts":[{"text":"கயம்","lemma":"kayam","gloss":"pond"}],"gloss":"pond"},{"surface":"மூழ்கு","parts":[{"text":"மூழ்கு","lemma":"mūḻku","gloss":"plunge/bathe"}],"gloss":"bathing"},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"makaḷir","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"},{"surface":"கண்ணின்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"in","gloss":"like (comparative)"}],"gloss":"like the eyes"},{"surface":"மானும்","parts":[{"text":"மானும்","lemma":"māṉum","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"resembling"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தண்ணம்","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"taṇ","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"beautiful/euphonic"}],"gloss":"cool"},{"surface":"துறைவன்","parts":[{"text":"துறை","lemma":"tuṟai","gloss":"shore"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"an","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"lord of the shore"},{"surface":"கொடுமை","parts":[{"text":"கொடுமை","lemma":"koṭumai","gloss":"cruelty"}],"gloss":"cruelty"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நம்முன்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"nam","gloss":"our"},{"text":"முன்","lemma":"muṉ","gloss":"before"}],"gloss":"before us"},{"surface":"நாணி","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"nāṇ","gloss":"shyness/shame"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"having felt (verbal participle)"}],"gloss":"feeling shy"},{"surface":"கரப்பாடும்மே","parts":[{"text":"கரப்பாடு","lemma":"karappāṭu","gloss":"concealment"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and/even"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she hides indeed"}]}],"literal":"My mother has become she of dark complexion / In a well-fitted lid casket solitary stayed / unworn flower-like body she has wasted away / Green leaf risen thick-stemmed water lily / shoal of fish dark backwater tide whenever overflows / pond bathing women's eyes resembles / cool shore's lord's cruelty / before us feeling shy she hides indeed","translation":"She of dark complexion has become as dear to me as my own mother. Her body has wasted away like an unworn flower kept solitary inside a well-crafted casket. Yet, she hides the cruelty of the lord of the cool shore from us, feeling shy—the shore where thick-stemmed water lilies rising above green leaves resemble the eyes of women bathing in the pond whenever the tide overflows the dark backwater rich with fish.","modern":"என் தாயைப் போன்றவள் ஆகிய கரிய நிறமுடையவள், நன்றாகச் செய்யப்பட்ட சிமிழில் தனியாக வைக்கப்பட்ட சூடப்படாத மலரைப் போலத் தன் உடல் மெலிந்து போனாள். பசுமையான இலைகளுக்கு மேலே உயர்ந்த திரண்ட தண்டினையுடைய நெய்தல் மலர், மீன் கூட்டங்கள் நிறைந்த கரிய கழியில் ஓதம் நிறையும் போதெல்லாம் குளத்தில் மூழ்கி விளையாடும் மகளிரின் கண்களைப் போலத் தோன்றும். அத்தகைய குளிர்ந்த துறையை உடைய தலைவனின் கொடுமையை அவள் நம்மிடம் சொல்ல வெட்கப்பட்டு மறைக்கின்றாள்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine's confidante (தோழி) to herself or to those around her, observing the heroine's deteriorating health. The heroine is wasting away in secret due to the separation and neglect of her lover, the lord of the maritime tract. The confidante compares the heroine's fading beauty to a fresh flower locked away in a casket, unused and unseen. The landscape of the maritime shore (marutam/neytal transition) is described with water lilies that look like the eyes of bathing women when the tide rises. This vivid imagery reflects how the heroine's own beautiful eyes are constantly flooded with tears, yet she chooses to hide her pain and her lover's cruelty out of deep shyness and loyalty.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.28],[0.28,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,3.3],[3.3,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,4.65],[4.65,6.4],[6.4,6.7],[6.7,7.24],[7.24,7.78],[7.78,8.5],[8.5,9.2],[9.2,9.4],[9.4,9.56],[9.56,10.62],[10.62,11.05],[11.14,11.4],[11.4,13.6],[13.6,13.8],[13.8,14.2],[14.2,14.5],[14.5,16.2],[16.2,16.6],[16.6,16.8],[17.15,17.6],[17.6,18.05],[18.05,18.65],[18.65,19.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.32],[0.32,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,2.0],[2.0,3.6],[3.6,3.8],[3.8,4.2],[4.2,4.6],[4.6,4.97],[4.97,6.8],[6.8,7.1],[7.16,7.5],[7.5,8.19],[8.19,9.1],[9.1,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,11.95],[11.95,12.6],[12.65,12.94],[12.94,13.8],[13.8,14.97],[14.97,15.9],[15.9,16.1],[16.1,16.3],[16.3,18.1],[18.1,18.5],[18.5,18.7],[19.05,19.52],[19.52,20.0],[20.0,20.63],[20.63,21.1]]},"sync":[[["யாய்","my mother"]],[["ஆகியளே","she has become"]],[["மாஅயோளே","she of dark complexion"]],[["மாஅயோளே","she of dark complexion"]],[["மடைமாண்","well-fitted lid"]],[["செப்பில்","in the casket"]],[["தமிய","solitary"]],[["வைகிய","having stayed"]],[["பெய்யா","unworn"]],[["பூவின்","like a flower"]],[["மெய்","body"],["சாயினளே","she has wasted away"]],[["சாயினளே","she has wasted away"]],[["பாசடை","green leaf"]],[["நிவந்த","grown tall"]],[["கணைக்கால்","thick-stemmed"]],[["நெய்தல்","water lily"]],[["இனமீன்","shoal of fish"]],[["இனமீன்","shoal of fish"],["இருங்கழி","dark backwater"]],[["ஓதம்","tide"]],[["மல்குதொறும்","whenever it overflows"]],[["கயம்","pond"],["மூழ்கு","bathing"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["கண்ணின்","like the eyes"]],[["மானும்","resembling"]],[["தண்ணம்","cool"]],[["துறைவன்","lord of the shore"]],[["கொடுமை","cruelty"]],[["நம்முன்","before us"]],[["நம்முன்","before us"],["நாணி","feeling shy"]],[["கரப்பாடும்மே","she hides indeed"]],[["கரப்பாடும்மே","she hides indeed"]]]}